# Rensei — Claude Instructions

- Rensei is an open-world dark industrial-fantasy action RPG built in Roblox Studio.
- Read `README.md` and `CLAUDE_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` before proposing implementation.
- Treat the existing Roblox game as the source of truth for what is already implemented.
- **Never assume a feature exists just because it is in the design documents.**
- Preserve working systems. Audit before changing code.
- Do not delete, rename, replace, or rewrite existing scripts without explaining why and getting approval.
- Do not publish the Roblox game or modify live player data.
- Do not expose API keys, credentials, private player data, or other secrets.
- Start with read-only inspection and a report of the existing architecture.
- Before making changes, propose a small, testable plan and identify affected scripts.
- Keep changes focused, explain how to test them in Roblox Studio, and document any assumptions.
- The Nemesis system is shelved unless explicitly brought back into scope.
- Ask before introducing new dependencies, frameworks, or major architecture changes.
